    "<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{key}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">key</span></span></span></span></span> 和 value 由小写英文字母和数字组成",
